Smart Aero Field
Copyright 2026 Scarlet (NASA Space Apps Challenge)

This product includes software developed by Scarlet
for the NASA International Space Apps Challenge 2026.

This project incorporates and builds upon:
1. NASA POWER Agroclimatology Methodology (MERRA-2 and GEOS-5 FP-IT data assimilation)
2. NASA Global Precipitation Measurement (GPM) IMERG constellation dataset
3. NASA MODIS Terra/Aqua Land Surface Temperature and NDVI telemetry
4. Bangladesh Rice Research Institute (BRRI) & BARC agricultural standards
